            <title>1.5.6</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 07:34:55 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>33</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Overhead 1.5.6</h3><ul>
<li>Fixed: reopening Overhead from the Dock, a widget or a notification after its window had been closed could bring back a window with a solid dark band across the top, with the sidebar and map squeezed in below it. That window now looks the same as the one it stands in for</li>
<li>Fixed: the log attached to Send Support Report could arrive padded with a long stretch of nothing at the start if the file had been emptied while Overhead was running. It arrives clean now</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
