        <item>
            <title>1.5.4</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 10:48:22 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>31</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Overhead 1.5.4</h3><ul>
<li>Two switches for fun, in Settings → General → Fun, both off unless you turn them on. Radio callsigns shows Speedbird 283 rather than BAW283, the names airlines use on the air, wherever a callsign appears in the window; airlines Overhead does not know keep their codes, and widgets keep them too. 1962 scope puts the glass of an old tube in front of the Radar Scope: scanlines, phosphor bloom, a vignette and a faint flicker, which stops with Reduce Motion</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
